  "provider": "codex-cli:gpt-5.6-sol:medium",
  "raw": "{\"judgements\":[{\"id\":\"T1\",\"kind\":\"answered_later\",\"quotes\":[\"A missing or empty URL never reaches this function, because load_runtime_settings refuses the service start for it, and this function MUST NOT catch, translate or repair a refusal of load_runtime_settings.\"],\"later_state\":null,\"precedent\":null,\"divergence\":\"\",\"why\":\"The later notes require any refusal from load_runtime_settings to propagate without translation into a RegistryBoundaryError.\",\"witness\":{\"initial\":\"\",\"events\":[],\"outcomes\":[],\"observer\":\"\",\"basis\":[]},\"bases\":[],\"rule\":\"\",\"section\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"T2\",\"kind\":\"standard_violation\",\"quotes\":[\"`module:runtime`, `module:staff_bootstrap_cli`, and `module:registry_gateway`\\nfor the Registry URL (owner 2026-11-09, A30).\"],\"later_state\":null,\"precedent\":null,\"divergence\":\"\",\"why\":\"The Callers passage includes registry_gateway even though the authoritative State 5 import plan omits that consumer, as confirmed by the deterministic callers-mismatch result.\",\"witness\":{\"initial\":\"\",\"events\":[],\"outcomes\":[],\"observer\":\"\",\"basis\":[]},\"bases\":[],\"rule\":\"- `module_internal` — явный граф зависимостей: consumer → provider → список\\n  импортируемых символов. Имена consumer/provider — логические ключи из\\n  `module_functions`; каждый символ обязан принадлежать provider. Это\\n  **единственный авторитетный источник** внутренних импортов consumer-а:\\n  объявленные символы входят в его локальную спеку всегда\",\"section\":\"7\"},{\"id\":\"T3\",\"kind\":\"answered\",\"quotes\":[\"A30's environment part: load, normalize, default and validate the closed\\ntable `config.runtime_environment_variables` into `RuntimeSettings` at each\\ncall of `load_runtime_settings` — once at start by `runtime` and by the\\nbootstrap command, and again at each Registry call by `registry_gateway`\\n(owner 2026-11-09) — including the startup consistency of the binary bounds (A14). Factory\\n`38626cc7be12`.\"],\"later_state\":null,\"precedent\":null,\"divergence\":\"\",\"why\":\"The module text makes “once” mean one validation per invocation and explicitly requires another invocation at every Registry call.\",\"witness\":{\"initial\":\"\",\"events\":[],\"outcomes\":[],\"observer\":\"\",\"basis\":[]},\"bases\":[],\"rule\":\"\",\"section\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"T4\",\"kind\":\"answered\",\"quotes\":[\"- CFG-002: `runtime_settings_client_portal`: for each required variable\\n  other than `REGISTRY_BASE_URL` a missing value and an invalid value stop\\n  start-up; a missing, empty or whitespace-only `REGISTRY_BASE_URL` stops\\n  it, while any other value is accepted at start whatever its form (A6\\n  refuses an unusable one at each call); and a complete valid environment\\n  starts.\"],\"later_state\":null,\"precedent\":null,\"divergence\":\"\",\"why\":\"Startup accepts every nonempty Registry URL regardless of form, and an unusable value is refused by the gateway at each call.\",\"witness\":{\"initial\":\"\",\"events\":[],\"outcomes\":[],\"observer\":\"\",\"basis\":[]},\"bases\":[],\"rule\":\"\",\"section\":\"\"}]}",
